stern collectors' desire for such carvings","correct":false,"public_id":"fa0c7c29-c19e-4d46-a215-372d6c8785bb","blank_index":null,"order_index":1,"question_id":61,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"the fact that other materials were used previously","correct":false,"public_id":"4a137b6c-1d00-4ff0-885a-09303bc35989","blank_index":null,"order_index":2,"question_id":61,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"destruction of the carvings because of religion","correct":false,"public_id":"d558b14b-1c10-40b5-8919-8ac633199718","blank_index":null,"order_index":3,"question_id":61,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"problems caused by insects","correct":true,"public_id":"43c746d2-cf30-42c3-8c07-cf6514e334f0","blank_index":null,"order_index":4,"question_id":61,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"observing what happens during lessons","correct":true,"public_id":"08e0401e-80b0-4461-bc59-bbe8e664998d","blank_index":null,"order_index":0,"question_id":62,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"evaluating the materials used","correct":false,"public_id":"aea76cfb-f14f-4392-8ba6-fce13d0ccd7f","blank_index":null,"order_index":1,"question_id":62,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"analysing the content of tests","correct":false,"public_id":"35d14fa4-d96a-49ff-b9fb-c2468de8bb78","blank_index":null,"order_index":2,"question_id":62,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"considering what is taken into account when preparing the curriculum","correct":true,"public_id":"79f4018d-8d26-4d3f-b993-ac528c81b4fa","blank_index":null,"order_index":3,"question_id":62,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"comparing this curriculum with other choices that could have been made","correct":false,"public_id":"fd63f2ce-31aa-47e0-bedb-37c3b3a54720","blank_index":null,"order_index":4,"question_id":62,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"It has been a tourist attraction for decades.","correct":false,"public_id":"cc85dc9e-50d2-4a4d-a614-c54212739a07","blank_index":null,"order_index":0,"question_id":63,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"It is a drifting piece of wood.","correct":true,"public_id":"80824750-86ed-4e10-9713-cbf4bcf38ba1","blank_index":null,"order_index":1,"question_id":63,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"It is close to the edge of Crater Lake.","correct":false,"public_id":"6f37c904-e204-46aa-a533-39d1e219f907","blank_index":null,"order_index":2,"question_id":63,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"It is owned by a local businessman.","correct":false,"public_id":"cf4ac78e-c412-4316-ab90-2f71a7a45bf7","blank_index":null,"order_index":3,"question_id":63,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"It can quickly move about the lake.","correct":true,"public_id":"aceaec45-0285-4e93-8218-6286208ef1d1","blank_index":null,"order_index":4,"question_id":63,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"It can be a danger to boat users.","correct":true,"public_id":"f436cf08-71e6-4900-97d9-95c8751cba08","blank_index":null,"order_index":5,"question_id":63,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"It is too small for someone to stand on.","correct":false,"public_id":"2062beec-3ef9-4bfe-a209-264dc3b0c6bc","blank_index":null,"order_index":6,"question_id":63,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"For example, the sherbet you used for the chapter problem on page 25 is a mixture of baking soda and citric acid.","correct":false,"public_id":"bfccb758-e131-4b97-8ff3-5e8e4d031d95","blank_index":null,"order_index":0,"question_id":64,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"Another example of an endothermic reaction is seen with the cold packs used by athletes to treat injuries. These packs usually consist of a plastic bag containing ammonium nitrate dissolves in the water.","correct":false,"public_id":"2126aa5e-0135-46ad-9819-9fdc6d8505c9","blank_index":null,"order_index":1,"question_id":64,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"When it is mixed with water in your mouth, an endothermic reaction occurs, taking heat energy from your mouth and making it feel cooler.","correct":false,"public_id":"c49d0463-0ee3-4224-8a48-c76770893b4f","blank_index":null,"order_index":2,"question_id":64,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"A reaction that needs some type of energy to make it go is said to be endothermic. It takes in energy.","correct":false,"public_id":"be4cb4de-b9b8-4347-9703-d33ea37562e0","blank_index":null,"order_index":3,"question_id":64,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"This process is endothermic-taking heat energy from the surroundings and cooling the injured part of your body. In this way, the cold pack acts as an ice pack.","correct":false,"public_id":"1277cea4-7789-48a7-af5f-5aeb9cb2e7dc","blank_index":null,"order_index":4,"question_id":64,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"The topic you choose should be supported by a range of sources.","correct":false,"public_id":"8aaef8dc-c34c-45f0-94a7-2dbd5be448fe","blank_index":null,"order_index":0,"question_id":65,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"The source should be cited under APA guidelines, and the final draft should be written in APA styles.","correct":false,"public_id":"fcc96147-4b77-4194-be1e-f825231ba5d7","blank_index":null,"order_index":1,"question_id":65,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"The final draft is due one week before the final exam.","correct":false,"public_id":"cfcaf099-4416-4052-999e-4f9217040c0d","blank_index":null,"order_index":2,"question_id":65,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"A requirement of Humanities 104 is to write a persuasive paper on a topic of your choice.","correct":false,"public_id":"d5c37643-f3ed-4718-8a5a-e7e9b6026a79","blank_index":null,"order_index":3,"question_id":65,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"A Technology for recording brainwaves in wild animals awakens a more sophisticated understanding of the function of sleep.","correct":false,"public_id":"8a41f850-61ef-4af3-851d-8fec9907ef7e","blank_index":null,"order_index":0,"question_id":66,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"Studies using miniature sleep recording devices known as neurologgers have already challenged several long-held beliefs about the sleeping habits of sloths and birds.","correct":false,"public_id":"49c5f41f-d881-4e6f-af25-f4e9fdc195e1","blank_index":null,"order_index":1,"question_id":66,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"And male sandpipers can go almost entirely without sleep during the three-week breeding season, helping maximize success at that time.","correct":false,"public_id":"5809e3b7-be0c-4f28-9d76-ac69abf6974d","blank_index":null,"order_index":2,"question_id":66,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"Three toed sloths, for example, sleep far less than once thought.","correct":false,"public_id":"cd0c9d30-e0b2-4b73-a55c-996f3b3bcb3c","blank_index":null,"order_index":3,"question_id":66,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"Now John Lesku of La Trobe University in Melbourne and his colleagues are using neurologgers to investigate whether light pollution interferes with the circadian rhythms of tammar wallabies in Australia.","correct":false,"public_id":"f72f9754-c37d-42fa-8090-0ac23b82981b","blank_index":null,"order_index":4,"question_id":66,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"suffered","correct":true,"public_id":"d3119ac6-24d9-4bd0-85d0-3cbff4b9bb2d","blank_index":null,"order_index":0,"question_id":67,"correct_gap_index":0},{"text":"endure","correct":false,"public_id":"78b6f3e9-2e04-4022-8a13-764147abd0b9","blank_index":null,"order_index":1,"question_id":67,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"while","correct":false,"public_id":"4176a50e-43f1-4a31-97a3-378e505ad9e8","blank_index":null,"order_index":2,"question_id":67,"correct_gap_index":null},{"text":"continent","correct":true,"public_id":"296cb6d6-4dd6-4a6d-9be0-921c7b6dc037","blank_index":null,"order_index":3,"question_id":67,"correct_gap_index":3},{"text":"remains","correct":true,"public_id":"8d5179b4-8b08-4140-98be-6dad5c782af2","blank_index":null,"order_index":4,"question_id":67,"correct_gap_index":2},{"text":"enjoyed","correct":false,"public_id":"27d7f9cd-c84f-4380-92ed-90e7e3d079d6","blank_index":null,"order_index":5,"question_id":67,"correct_gap_index":null},{"